<title>UK: Algeria cuts low sulphur gas oil price - trade.</title>
<headline>Algeria cuts low sulphur gas oil price - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Algerian oil company Sonatrach and contract holders have agreed a lower price for low sulphur gas oil for delivery in January, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>They said contract holders would pay $1.50 below the formula, which is based on diesel prices in northern Europe and the Mediterranean.</p>
<p>Sonatrach obtained a $2.50 premium to the formula in November and October. No deliveries were agreed in December.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
